    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d537">

                <pb facs="0765" n="753" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg753"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 PW/10–1545: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">General of the Army Douglas
                            MacArthur to the Joint Chiefs of
                            Staff
                    </hi><anchor n="46" xml:id="d537-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-15">October 15,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>CA 53312. Reourad CA 52773, urgent requirement exists for clarification of status
                    of foreign governments and nationals of both <list>
                        <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>)</label>
                        <item>Neutral countries and</item>
                        <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>)</label>
                        <item>Countries with which United Nations were at war.</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <p>Should transactions with neutral countries be conducted directly with this
                    headquarters or through Japanese Government?</p>
                <p>What is policy concerning funds of former hostile countries presently under
                    protective custody of neutral powers?</p>
                <p>Request reply<anchor n="46a" xml:id="d537-f2"/> be expedited in view of financial
                    directives this headquarters involving holdings these agencies.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d537-f1" n="46" type="source" xml:id="d537-f1-content">
                <p>Forwarded to the Department by the War Department.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d537-f2" n="46a" xml:id="d537-f2-content">
                <p>See telegram Warx 84704, November 23, to Tokyo, <ref target="#pg864">p.
                    864</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
